{"id":"bcw6rftqp4n35ph7ocdnyhm6m","title":"医保钱包代缴居民医保费统筹地区范围不断扩大","originalTitle":null,"summary":"截至11月15日，全国31个省（自治区、直辖市）和新疆生产建设兵团的380个统筹地区支持使用医保钱包2.0版缴纳居民医保费，累计代缴141.09万人次、金额5.4亿元，其中河北、河南、山西、甘肃、湖南等五省占比67.81%。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"36氪"},"links":{"original":"https://36kr.com/newsflashes/4073119902929796?f=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T00:38:41.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T00:43:37.427Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T00:43:37.427Z","category":"clinical","tags":["政策发布"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2779125f-4714-443d-93ca-a36caa6a9f59","title":"医保钱包2.0版覆盖全国380个统筹地区代缴居民医保"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2779125f-4714-443d-93ca-a36caa6a9f59","title":"医保钱包2.0版覆盖全国380个统筹地区代缴居民医保"}],"topics":[{"slug":"research-policy","name":"科研政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fxNcGsQCkqcE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}